      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错，挑战三冠不仅事关\n目白光明的个人胜负，\n同时也是目白家一直以来的挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fad8d62724356cd1ad54ed25399c281b0ebcfc3e4b3a95a6db28ab4ef5975e29",
