    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7a15d737ba7f0784c3fd5fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“调配比赛进程”。意思就是能否按照自己的\n需求控制比赛发展，此要素会大大影响胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e217e4f1e6fc9786300c8886d74abc86df8bfeae724d1825262a97d2ee032a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69008d93850885e3cd8183d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能够调配比赛的赛马娘，多为擅长领头或\n占据前列的选手。她们能够借由掌握整体步调\n来创造出对自己有利的比赛发展──",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcaae067f364883e4d35fd73af02a027846b7f9ba368c4101b4214e892400d24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af927f55dd1eb3ea4fe35bf5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但擅长尾段加速的赛马娘却办不到这点，\n因此若比赛步调不适合自己就会陷入苦战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fcfa81b2e633c19a88d2dc46f312beb59fa4aa8e0fe430b920103947f1475e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074114.json",
